    "secondaryResults": "",
    "safety": "All TIMI major bleeding episodes through day 7 were increased with pretreatment (hazard ratio 1.90; 95% CI 1.19 to 3.02; P=0.006). The rates of TIMI major bleeding and life-threatening bleeding not related to coronary-artery bypass grafting were increased by a factor of 3 and 6, respectively. All results were confirmed at 30 days and in prespecified subgroups.",
