    "secondaryResults": "Death from any cause, nonfatal myocardial infarction, or nonfatal stroke was 3.9% in both groups (difference -0.06 percentage points; 95% CI -0.97 to 0.84; hazard ratio 0.99; 95% CI 0.78 to 1.25; P<0.001 for noninferiority).",
